/obj/item/clothing/cloak/templar/undivided
	name = "pantheonic tabard"
	desc = "The refuge of the PENTACLE upon my back. A Undivided House, standing eternal against the encroaching darkness."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/templar/undividedcleric
	name = "pantheonic devotee tabard"
	desc = "The refuge of the GREATEST GODS upon my back. A Great Wheel, to carry the light amongst the ever-present darkness that looms ahead."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/templar/undivided_alt
	desc = "The refuge of the DIVINE WILLS upon my back. An Almighty Temple, standing eternal against the encroaching darkness."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/cape/inquisitorsilver
	desc = "A time honored cloak inlined with silver threading, the stitchwork tethers it to the Silver Orders; a catch-all term for the various faith-militances that \
	ward Psydonia from monsters, creechers, and the ever-looming threat of assault of the Anatheme."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/undivided
	name = "pantheonic cloak"
	desc = "The refuge of the PENTACLE upon my back. A Undivided House, standing eternal against the encroaching darkness."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/undividedcleric
	desc = "The refuge of the PENTACLE upon my back. A Undivided Pantheon, to carry the light amongst the ever-present darkness that looms ahead."
	name = "pantheonic devotee cloak"

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/half/shadowcloak
	desc = "A heavy leather cloak held together by a gilded pin, depicting the Count's court. The sign of a faithful servant."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/wardencloak
	desc = "A cloak of dense, thick wool worn by the Wardens of the Scarland's forests. Incredibly warm, \
	and doubles as a blanket in a pinch."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/forrestercloak/snow
	desc = "A cloak meant to keep one's body warm in the cold of the mountains as well as the dampness of the lowlands."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/banneret
	desc = "A cape with a gold embroided heraldry of Pharos."

/obj/item/clothing/cloak/kazengun
	desc = "A simple kind of Kazengunite surcoat, worn here in the distant fields of Pharos to differentiate friend from foe."

/obj/item/clothing/head/roguetown/crown/serpcrown
	name = "Crown of Pharos"

/obj/item/clothing/shoes/roguetown/sandals/aalloy
	desc = "Rotted metal platforms, curled about to cradle the feet. The beaches that these sandals once treaded are no more; pearly sands eroded away by eons."

/obj/item/clothing/shoes/roguetown/boots/maille/bronze
	desc = "A pair of leather boots, reinforced with smaller bronze plates along the feet and ankles. A thick layer of chainmail has been woven across \
	the cuffs of each boot, and tastefully stitched into place. Between the glory of Ur-Syon's collapse and the rise of the Pentacle Divine, these soles \
	carried the steps of armies-a-plenty across the yet-supple steppes."

/obj/item/clothing/head/roguetown/helmet/heavy/undivided
	desc = "A silver-plated jousting helm, and symbol of hope worn by the templars of the Pentagrammatic Gods. Those who don it have sworn to lay down their lyves for the greater good, for no cost is too great to preserve Their will."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/chaincoif/paalloy
	desc = "Polished gilbranze rings, linked together to form a billowing hood. Let it not be a crown of thorns that saves this dying world, but a crown of change, ultimate; of fettered metal and stained bone, rejuvenated by Zizo's will to herald its greatest works yet."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/g
	desc = "'Paradise awaits.'"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/silver/naledi
	desc = "'Paradise awaits!' </br>The surface is meticulously lined with Naledian glyphs, said to ward off the possessive allure of djinns."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/aalloy
	desc = "'The greatest of sacrifice - the greatest of loss. The Shattering was divine suicide, surely - ripping his infinite power away and casting it across the world: keeping Anathema from harvesting Him whole. It still yet sundered our world-- cracking the skies, staining what IS with what IS-NOT. We weep. We suffer. We burn - for HIM.'"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/paalloy
	desc = "'The greatest of sacrifice - the greatest of loss. The Shattering was divine suicide, surely - ripping his infinite power away and casting it across the world: keeping Anathema from harvesting Him whole. It still yet sundered our world-- cracking the skies, staining what IS with what IS-NOT. We weep. We suffer. We burn - for HIM.'"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/aalloy
	desc = "A symbol of power from an era soon shattered."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/paalloy
	desc = "'Ascension. Destiny. Reign. A mandate, commanded by the Demiurge, to be fufilled by the dead and ab-dead. IT called us forth from the edge of reality - and with their dying breath, rasped out the final truth; the fire is gone, and the world will soon follow.'"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/iron
	desc = "'Zaios Dei.'"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/matthios/g
	desc = "He was but one flame in the dark. Together, His flock shall outblaze the Tyrant-Sun, and shall dance, together, without shackles to bind or Law to restrain them. Any law."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/graggar/g
	desc = "Reach heaven through Violence."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/graggar/wood
	desc = "When all you have is a hammer, every problem tends to look like a skull."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/baotha
	desc = "A modest promise rendered in manchmal gilt. It is soft, and warm to the touch; hard to part from, when held - wishing to drink deeper of you and your life, if only for a moment."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/baotha/g
	desc = "A cherished relic, rendered in gold and glistening with value. How you love this life; how you cherish its every second! O, may us merge in Heaven, l'Opus-Opia!"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/inhumen/baotha/wood
	desc = "Drown the past, cherish the present, and perfect the future."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/undivided
	name = "amulet of the Pantheon"
	desc = "The Wills eternal, strength in unity. Stalwart for centuries against the darkness."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/silver/undivided
	name = "silver amulet of the Pantheon"
	desc = "Ward of silver, sigil of eternity; by the Pentacle, I command thee back to Hell!"

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/undivided/g
	name = "golden amulet of the Pantheon"
	desc = "The Blessed Pentacle, crossing lines eternal, unified in strength. For centuries, their glistening light has remained stalwart against the darkness."

/obj/item/clothing/neck/roguetown/psicross/undivided/wood
	name = "wooden amulet of the Pantheon"

/obj/item/clothing/ring/signet
	desc = "A ring of opulent gold, bearing the Lord's symbol. Its face is cut to seal writs of courtly importance, and a fresh bead of tallow rests in the underside."

/obj/item/clothing/ring/signet/silver
	desc = "A ring of glistening silver, bearing the Lord's symbol. Its face is cut to seal writs of courtly importance, a bead of tallow nested in the underside."

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/unholy/lich
	desc = "An otherworldly veil, whispering a hundred paradoxical answers to the ultimate question. Her hand guides your grandest missive; to become as Gods, to break this flawed world, to make yours greater - no matter the cost."

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/unholy/enchanted
	desc = "An otherworldly veil, amythortz-woven and crackling with the constant ponderance of a runic enigma. Her hand guides your grandest missive; to become as Gods, to break this flawed world, to make yours greater - no matter the cost."

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/undivided
	name = "pantheonic robe"
	desc = "Undivided, we stand - a Pantheon of the Five Greatest Wills, shepherding Psydonia's flock towards providence."

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/undividedcleric
	name = "pantheonic clerical robe"
	desc = "Undivided, we walk - a Pentagrammatic Pantheon, guiding Psydonia's wanderers towards providence."

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/eora/alt
	desc = "Used by more radical followers of Eora"

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/pointfex
	name = "medjai's qaba"

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/robe/pointfex/loadout
	name = "aesthetic medjai's qaba"

/obj/item/clothing/suit/roguetown/shirt/dress/captainrobe
	desc = "Flower-styled robes. The Pharovian Trading Company's factor swears they came up the harbor from the Nine Isles of Kazengun themselves."

/obj/item/clothing/wrists/roguetown/bracers/cloth/naledi
	desc = "Sheared burlap and cloth, meticulously fashioned around the forearms. Naledian-trained monks rarely share the same fatalistic mindset as their Otavan cousins, and - consequency - tend to be averse with binding their wrists in jagged thorns. Unbloodied fingers tend to work far better with the arcyne, too. </br>'..And so, the great tears that they wept when it took its last breath, the rain of the Weeping, is what marked this era of silence. Fools would tell you that Psydon has died, that they splintered into 'smaller fragments', but that does not make sense. They are everything within and without, they are beyond size and shape. How can everything become something? No, they have merely turned their ear from us. They mourn, for their greatest child and their worst..'"
